Z||000006||8Ball||11-07-2001||08:27 PM||||We just went thru an ordeal not more than an hour ago in which I ALMOST WENT TO JAIL!!! Because I am sick. Do not feel good. Was in bed trying to sleep. The neighbors horrid out of control kids were screaming and shouting in my yard UNDER MY bedroom window. I ask them to leave they inform me they didn't have to I insist they leave MY yard. Then one calls me a mother f**ker!!! I said look you little bast**d get out of my f**king yard!!! Well long story short cops come over and inform me that cussing a child no matter what is child abuse and I could spend a good long stretch in jail for it. <P>I am sick and tired of people takeing up for kids just because they are kids!!! This one and the one in the pic is no better than someone who would punch a stranger just for the fun or rob you blind and there for deserves to be treated that way!!!!<P>My wife is sitting here and she says, There is an almost obscenely disproportionit value placed on children. I say, if the child warrents regard it will get it. Otherwise they should recieve the punishment they deserve for their behaviour. Personally I think they are only worth what you can get for them on the black market. per pound.||||reg||1
