Z||000023||Fierowrecker||11-08-2001||02:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by dennis_6:<BR><B>Do remember $30 bucks to a guy who owns a 200 grand car is like 30 cents to us.  The guy was jerk, the kid was a jerk.  The guy was supposed to be and adult though.  If I was the father both of them would have been sorry.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Doesn't matter what the value of the caps were, or the price of the car...<BR>The little $hit deserved to be horse whipped for stealing...<BR>I would have welcomed the so called parent that would take a swing at me, especially if it were in front of the cops, I would break his arm while defending myself, and have him arrested...<BR>Reminds me of the time I caught two kids going through my garage...<BR>Grabbed my shotgun and waited outside the door...<BR>When they came out, I fired a shot into the air...<BR>One kid evacuated his bowels right there...<BR>The cops that took them home had a good laugh over that one!<BR>BTW, they moved out of the area...||||reg||1
