Z||000027||KathyHL||11-08-2001||05:33 AM||||Valve stems today,<BR>wheels and tires at 14<BR>Chop shops and banks at 18+??<P>Yeah, Jay....you did right. About a month ago after buying my Indy, some kids were throwing hedgeapples at passing cars and hit mine. I threw back in reverse and pulled up in there driveway (while the little S--ts were trying to duck behind bushes. Well, Granny was watching the kids (yeah, right) and answered the door. In a pissed off tone of voice and attitude I told her what happened, and she says "Well, they are just kids". I get so tired of hearing that crap. A lot of kids actions can get people killed. Rocks and bowling balls off overpasses on highways. What would have happened if the hedgeaple went through the window, causing me to go out of control and hitting them or someone else! Yeah, because they are kids, that's all right! B.S.!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://sofa.iwarp.com/Indyfiero2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000028||Springtyme||11-08-2001||08:57 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:  <BR><B>remember he was going to the store to buy shoes? that departmant store is where he probably drug the kid when he caught him in order to call the police<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, but in the story it says "There were 3 huge cops, who made the kid sit on the<BR>ground as they questioned him" and him being up on a table like that doesn't seem to me as sitting on the ground... Maybe I just look into things too much... As for this...<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KathyHL:<BR><B>About a month ago after buying my Indy, some kids were throwing hedgeapples at passing cars and hit mine.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Eric was workin on his car a few weeks ago and I was there helpin him. Well I saw two kids runnin around the yard and they were lookin in the garage at us. I asked Eric who they were and he said he didn't know. Well I had to leave his parents house and run and get something from the auto parts store in town for him. As I came back down the road There were the same 2 little kids walkin up the road slowly. I just drove by like normal but watched them very closely in my mirrors. I saw the little blonde one (kinda looks like the kid above) turn around and at that I had myfoot on the brake. He chucked what I thought was a tomato at my car. I slammed on the brakes, threw it in park and got outta the car. "What the he!! do you kids think you're doing? Who are you?" They just stood there and stared at me like a deer in headlights. "Where do you live?" And the other kid pointed to the house at the top of the road. "You better get there and start explaining your side of the story. As soon as I park my car and make sure there's no damage, I'm comin up there to talk to your parents." They took off running. I never really did go up because it didn't hit my car, but when I got back to the garage I told Eric what happened. He realized that it was either apples or tomatoes they were throwing because his dad had a bunch setting out on the picnic table where they were snooping around. I was so incredibly mad that day!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Springtyme (edited 11-08-2001).]||||reg||11
