Z||000073||Darren's 87 coupe||11-10-2001||12:12 PM||||i realy agree with Boomer on this one, but i also agree with Cliff.  these are impressionistic times for the kid.  This is the impression that the guy should have left on the kid!!!!!!!!!  An impression that lasts till adulthood.  As for shrinks, i hardly ever think they know what's best for society.  Lessons like this can't be taught by a shrink.  And the parents were not doing the job either.  I'm not saying they were bad parents, but the situation did arise where they did steal and the lesson will now stick.  Writing a letter of apology will stick as a time when you got away with it.  Being scared to death will stick as a time you never want to repeat.  Also I heavily agree that how much money a man amkes should NEVER come into play with what was stolen, or how mad he got at the theft.  I am a poor individual that can't afford anyone to take what belongs to me, but when I make my fortunes, I will have done it honestly, and enjoy the thousands that I have earned as well as the 2$ parts that I am able to buy for my car.  Richness shouldn't matter.<BR>Darren||||reg||1
Z||000074||stsmithgt||11-10-2001||02:40 PM||||YOU DON'T DISCIPLINE OTHER PEOPLE'S KIDS??? WHAT???<P>Punishment may be out of line, but teaching them a lesson is not at all.  I discipline kids if I see them doing something wrong.  I don't punish them physically, but I do give them something to think about.  I dont' agree with adults using prophanity at or around kids either just look at the rules on this forum keep out those "bad" words. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>  On the other hand both my folks discipline several kids all the time.  You know where I'm going with this????<BR>Both my folks are teachers so taking someone's kid and teaching them a thing or two in class or out on the street is normal.  If the kid is doing something wrong, the parent has'nt taught them well enough not to do it or the parent doesn't know of the cituation yet to teach him/her otherwise.  As long as it's a productive influence in the long run, I'm all for other people helping out keeping kids out of trouble.||||reg||4
